msgstr "Affichera l’ID de la série"

#: inc/settings/settings-page.php:240
msgid "Will output the author of the post"
msgstr "Affichera l’auteur/autrice de la publication"

#: inc/settings/settings-page.php:250
msgid "If the post has a feature-image then that image will be displayed"
msgstr "Si la publication a une image mise en avant, cette image sera affichée"

